            <section class="story-carousel scroll-animate">
               <div class="story-carousel__header"><span class="decorative-lines-left"></span><h2 class="story-carousel__title">PSC Voices</h2>
                  <div class="story-carousel__subtitle">Join our supportive and inclusive community of dedicated faculty and staff here to
                     help you discover your path to success.</div><span class="decorative-lines-right"></span></div>
               <div class="story-carousel__holder">
                  <div class="story-carousel__wrapper">
                     <div class="story-carousel__item">
                        <div class="story-carousel__content">
                           <div class="cite__wrap"><span class="name">Emmanuel Lopez</span><span class="date">
                                 A.S., Biological Sciences ‘15
                                 </span></div>
                           <div class="story-display__quote">
                              "PSC helped me build my confidence; the leader I am now can be traced back to the
                              student experience I had at Prairie State College. Serving as the president of the
                              Student Government Association, president of the Sustainability Club, and vice president
                              of the All-Latin Association, expedited my professional and leadership skills."
                              </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="story-carousel__image"><img src="/_resources/images/emmanuellopezgraduationpicture.jpg" alt="Graduation picture of Emmanuel Lopez"></div>
                     </div>
                     <div class="story-carousel__item">
                        <div class="story-carousel__content">
                           <div class="cite__wrap"><span class="name">Carrington Valentine</span><span class="date">Current Student</span></div>
                           <div class="story-display__quote">"Being at community college, I understand what it feels like when a professor cares
                              about me. When I transfer out, I will quickly be able to identify if a professor looks
                              at me like a number or a student."</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="story-carousel__image"><img src="/_resources/images/carringtonvalentineheadshot.jpg" alt="Headshot of Carrington Valentine"></div>
                     </div>
                     <div class="story-carousel__item">
                        <div class="story-carousel__content">
                           <div class="cite__wrap"><span class="name">Natalie Rodriguez</span><span class="date">A.A., Business ‘23</span></div>
                           <div class="story-display__quote">"I'm in the Latin Alliance Club. I've met a lot of people who I can relate to in the
                              club and I know I'm going to be friends with the people in there for a long time.
                              Go for it. Don’t be scared. It has a bit of a negative connotation because you’re
                              not going straight to a four-year (institution). Once you’re here you realize it's
                              a more intimate community and you really get to know people." </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="story-carousel__image"><img src="/_resources/images/natalierodriguezheadshot.jpg" alt="Headshot of Natalie Rodriguez"></div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="btn-wrap">
                     <div class="story-carousel__buttons"><button class="prevArrow">previous</button><span class="decorative-lines"></span><button class="nextArrow">next</button><span class="decorative-lines"></span></div><span class="button-text">stay in touch</span></div>
               </div>
            </section>
            <section class="goal-selector">
               <div class="goal-selector__header">
                  <h2>Start your journey at PSC</h2><br><span>We are PSC</span></div>
               <div class="goal-selector__toggle"><button aria-current="true" id="goals-btn">by your goals</button><div class="toggle-slider"></div><button aria-current="false" id="interests-btn">by your interests</button></div>
               <div class="goal-selector__section">
                  <div class="goal-selector__tabs">
                     <div class="goal-selector__tabs__list" role="tablist"><button aria-selected="true" id="tab-1" class="toggle-subfilters tab" role="tab"><span class="icon-wrapper"><img src="/_resources/images/world.svg" alt=""></span><span class="btn-title">Transfer to a 4-year Institution</span><span class="close-icon"></span></button><button aria-selected="false" id="tab-2" class="toggle-subfilters tab" role="tab"><span class="icon-wrapper"><img src="/_resources/images/radio.svg" alt=""></span><span class="btn-title">
                              Prepare for a Career
                              </span><span class="close-icon"></span></button><button aria-selected="false" id="tab-3" class="toggle-subfilters tab" role="tab"><span class="icon-wrapper"><img src="/_resources/images/graph.svg" alt=""></span><span class="btn-title">Explore Flexible Learning Options</span><span class="close-icon"></span></button><button aria-selected="false" id="tab-4" class="toggle-subfilters tab" role="tab"><span class="icon-wrapper"><img src="/_resources/images/apple.svg" alt=""></span><span class="btn-title">Take Classes While In High School</span><span class="close-icon"></span></button><button aria-selected="false" id="tab-5" class="toggle-subfilters tab" role="tab"><span class="icon-wrapper"><img src="/_resources/images/target.svg" alt=""></span><span class="btn-title">
                              Pursue Professional Growth
                              </span><span class="close-icon"></span></button></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="goal-selector__panels">
                     <div class="goal-selector__panel__wrapper"><button class="toggle-subfilters active" aria-expanded="true"><span class="icon-wrapper"><img src="/_resources/images/world.svg" alt=""></span><span class="btn-title">Transfer to a 4-year Institution</span><span class="close-icon"></span></button><div aria-labelledby="tab-1" class="pathway-programs__panel form__item" style="display: block;">
                           <div class="form__item__wrapper">
                              <h3>Transfer to a 4-year Institution</h3>
                              <p>Prairie State College provides comprehensive guidance to students navigating the process
                                 of transferring to four-year universities. Our experienced counselors offer personalized
                                 assistance in selecting transferable courses, exploring transfer options, and completing
                                 application requirements. Let us help you successfully transition to your desired
                                 institution and achieve your academic goals.</p>
                              <div class="cta-wrapper"><img src="/_resources/images/world.svg" alt=""><td data-name="cta"><a class="goal-cta cta" title="Transfer Counseling" href="/student-resources/transfer-counseling/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Transfer Counseling</a></td>
                              </div>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                     <div class="goal-selector__panel__wrapper"><button class="toggle-subfilters" aria-expanded="false"><span class="icon-wrapper"><img src="/_resources/images/radio.svg" alt=""></span><span class="btn-title">
                              Prepare for a Career
                              </span><span class="close-icon"></span></button><div aria-labelledby="tab-2" class="pathway-programs__panel form__item" style="display: none;">
                           <div class="form__item__wrapper">
                              <h3>
                                 Prepare for a Career
                                 </h3>
                              <p>Career services provide invaluable support to college students by offering guidance
                                 and resources to navigate the complex job market. From resume building and interview
                                 preparation to networking opportunities and internships, they empower students to
                                 make informed career choices. With personalized advice and industry insights, career
                                 services maximize students' potential for success in their chosen fields.</p>
                              <div class="cta-wrapper"><img src="/_resources/images/radio.svg" alt=""><td data-name="cta"><a class="goal-cta cta" title="Career Services" href="/student-resources/career-services.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Career Services</a></td>
                              </div>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                     <div class="goal-selector__panel__wrapper"><button class="toggle-subfilters" aria-expanded="false"><span class="icon-wrapper"><img src="/_resources/images/graph.svg" alt=""></span><span class="btn-title">Explore Flexible Learning Options</span><span class="close-icon"></span></button><div aria-labelledby="tab-3" class="pathway-programs__panel form__item" style="display: none;">
                           <div class="form__item__wrapper">
                              <h3>Explore Flexible Learning Options</h3>
                              <p>Prairie State College offers a wide array of courses spanning various disciplines,
                                 with in-person, hybrid, and online options with multiple learning formats and flexible
                                 start dates to ensure students can pursue their education in a way that aligns with
                                 their preferences. </p>
                              <div class="cta-wrapper"><img src="/_resources/images/graph.svg" alt=""><td data-name="cta"><a class="goal-cta cta" title="Online Learning" href="/academics/online-learning/index.html">Flexible Learning Options</a>
                                    
                                    <p>&nbsp;</p>
                                    </td>
                              </div>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                     <div class="goal-selector__panel__wrapper"><button class="toggle-subfilters" aria-expanded="false"><span class="icon-wrapper"><img src="/_resources/images/apple.svg" alt="world icon"></span><span class="btn-title">Take Classes While In High School</span><span class="close-icon"></span></button><div aria-labelledby="tab-4" class="pathway-programs__panel form__item" style="display: none;">
                           <div class="form__item__wrapper">
                              <h3>Take Classes While In High School</h3>
                              <p>
                                 The Dual Credit program offers high school students the opportunity to earn both high
                                 school and college credit - at the same time. By taking qualified courses, students
                                 can transfer the credits they earn to PSC and other participating colleges and universities.
                                 Don't miss this opportunity for high school students to engage in college-level coursework
                                 and advance their educational journey. The program is free to high school students.
                                 </p>
                              <div class="cta-wrapper"><img src="/_resources/images/apple.svg" alt=""><td data-name="cta"><a class="goal-cta cta" title="Dual Degree Program" href="/academics/dual-credit/index.html">Dual Degree Program</a></td>
                              </div>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                     <div class="goal-selector__panel__wrapper"><button class="toggle-subfilters" aria-expanded="false"><span class="icon-wrapper"><img src="/_resources/images/target.svg" alt=""></span><span class="btn-title">
                              Pursue Professional Growth
                              </span><span class="close-icon"></span></button><div aria-labelledby="tab-5" class="pathway-programs__panel form__item" style="display: none;">
                           <div class="form__item__wrapper">
                              <h3>
                                 Pursue Professional Growth
                                 </h3>
                              <p>
                                 PSC offers diverse professional development and advancement opportunities, equipping
                                 students with essential skills, internships, networking events, and programs tailored
                                 to enhance and achieve long-term success.
                                 </p>
                              <div class="cta-wrapper"><img src="/_resources/images/target.svg" alt=""><td data-name="cta"><a class="goal-cta cta" title="Explore Workforce Development and Community Education" href="/workforce-development-and-community-education/index.html">Explore</a></td>
                              </div>
                           </div>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <div class="interest-section" style="display: none">
                  <div class="interest-section__wrapper">
                     <div class="interest-section__item"><span class="img-wrapper">
                           <td data-name="image"><img src="/_resources/images/Allied-Health-Homepage.jpg" alt="Allied Health"></td></span><a href="/academics/public-service-and-education/"><span class="content">Public Service and Education</span></a></div>
                     <div class="interest-section__item"><span class="img-wrapper">
                           <td data-name="image"><img src="/_resources/images/Career-Technical-Education.jpeg" alt="Career and Technical Education" width="800" height="534"></td></span><a href="/academics/manufacturing-and-construction/index.html"><span class="content">Manufacturing and Construction</span></a></div>
                     <div class="interest-section__item"><span class="img-wrapper">
                           <td data-name="image"><img src="https://prairiestate.edu/_resources/images/liberal-arts-and-sciences.jpg" alt="Liberal Arts and Sciences " width="1456" height="971"></td></span><a href="/academics/humanities-arts-and-social-sciences/index.html"><span class="content">Humanities and Social Sciences</span></a></div>
